For the foregoing reasons, I pass the following:
 ORDER  i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 26.09.2017 passed by the Senior Civil Judge and M.A.C.T, Sedam in MVC. No.1254/2015, is modified;
iii) The claimant is entitled for total compensation of Rs.44,98,820/- as against Rs.7,00,000/-
awarded by the Tribunal;
iv) Out of the compensation amount, Rs.35,00,000/-
shall be deposited in the name of appellant- claimant in any nationalized bank till he attains the age of majority.

